    <briefdescription>
<para>An integer-like constant. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It abstracts over scalar, fixed-length vectors, and scalable vectors. In the common case, it provides a common API and feels like an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_a_p_int" kindref="compound">APInt</ref>, while still providing low-level access. It can be used for constant-folding.</para>
<para>bool <ref refid="_lint_8cpp_1a45005634b54e2126cb3e6ec0dbc9ade4" kindref="member">isZero()</ref> abstracts over the kind.</para>
<para>switch(const.getKind()) { } provides low-level access. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
